WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.852
Indicators and signposts help analysts identify events or observations that suggest a situation may be changing.

00:00:05.852 --> 00:00:08.369
They connect current judgments to future evidence.

00:00:08.369 --> 00:00:11.605
Teams can ask what developments would support the assessment,

00:00:11.605 --> 00:00:15.919
what developments would challenge it, and which observable events should be monitored.

00:00:15.919 --> 00:00:19.515
Indicators support adaptive thinking by preventing conclusions from becoming frozen.

00:00:19.515 --> 00:00:23.829
If the environment changes, the assessment should have a way to update.

00:00:23.829 --> 00:00:27.784
This technique is useful in cybersecurity, investigations, risk management, business planning,

00:00:27.784 --> 00:00:30.660
and any environment where conditions can shift quickly.
